WEBVTT

00:21:57.708 --> 00:22:01.268
in the realm of relationships
at this moment, at work as well.

00:22:01.292 --> 00:22:05.059
And as a lot of what to do,
when people experienced breaches of trust,

00:22:05.083 --> 00:22:08.393
as happened definitely after #MeToo.

00:22:08.417 --> 00:22:11.351
And it shakes the whole foundation

00:22:11.375 --> 00:22:14.643
because all your expectations
are now up for grabs.

00:22:14.667 --> 00:22:16.351
Was I right about you?

00:22:16.375 --> 00:22:19.726
Did I completely misunderstand
who I thought I was for you?

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:23.851
Did I completely read wrong
what this partnership was actually about

00:22:23.875 --> 00:22:27.184
and you have nothing to hold on to

00:22:27.208 --> 00:22:28.934
because the relationship --

00:22:28.958 --> 00:22:31.268
So now comes the question,
how do we build it?